      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "The DB limiter wasn't implemented for safety reasons, it was implemented for *performance* reasons. That's why they aren't governed by trust rank, because it doesn't matter how much time you've spent in VRChat-- DB is stil a performance hog.\n*That being said*, I see what you mean about prioritizing friends. I'd like to have that too. There's probably a way for us to fit something like this into a feature we have on the way... 🤔",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
