      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{5acad9ecc9dba010c9c3ec68|full_name}: Separating the performance settings into the groups was requested alongside the minimum performance setting in June of last year. Did you have that tracked or are you only now putting this in? Just trying to understand if you are only now beginning to have more open communication or if that previous canny post was just ignored.",
